      "description": "<p>Expenditure on pensions measures public and, where relevant, private spending on cash pension benefits within social protection systems. Amounts are broken down by type of pension, including old-age, disability, survivors’ and early retirement benefits, and by whether entitlements are means-tested or non means-tested. Values are expressed in monetary units, per inhabitant and as a percentage of Gross Domestic Product (GDP), using harmonized definitions to ensure cross‑country comparability.</p>",
      "id": "SPR_EXP_PENS",
